DIAGNOSTICS
     For a basic explanation do

          pc

     See _p_i(1).  for an explanation of the error message format.
     Internal errors cause messages containing the word SNARK.

AUTHORS
     Charles B. Haley, William N. Joy, and Ken Thompson
     Retargetted to the second pass of the portable _C compiler by
     Peter Kessler
